{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic co-op loot-packing game where you and your friends build, box, and ship magical treasures before time runs out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work solo or with up to 4 players in couch co-op as you race against time, chaos, and your own questionable teamwork skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factory Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Conveyor belts jam, machines break down, and lava (yes, actual lava) tends to get in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How The Factory Works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, forge weapons, and enchant gear with whatever ingredients roll down the conveyor belt. Experiment to discover epic loot\u2014but be quick, or your supplies might vanish, burn, or turn into a disastrous creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Could Possibly Go Wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/206ea65c74c9fb96121a37435f4f4bc9.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511520?t=1763910033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763910033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/23b20113ebe0cc75a3d88a69bad3a0db9beb777a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763910033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/23b20113ebe0cc75a3d88a69bad3a0db9beb777a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763910033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3729420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic co-op loot-packing game where you and your friends build, box, and ship magical treasures before time runs out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/d965e9ee76b5a77cee1c4a1a8c2eb1c2.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work solo or with up to 4 players in couch co-op as you race against time, chaos, and your own questionable teamwork skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factory Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Conveyor belts jam, machines break down, and lava (yes, actual lava) tends to get in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/9e5667b8685242e6650c5213020f8568.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How The Factory Works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, forge weapons, and enchant gear with whatever ingredients roll down the conveyor belt. Experiment to discover epic loot\u2014but be quick, or your supplies might vanish, burn, or turn into a disastrous creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.poster.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.webm?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/ff66bf2a7c4d76011f600bf97002dfe1.mp4?t=1763910033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Could Possibly Go Wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/206ea65c74c9fb96121a37435f4f4bc9.avif?t=1763910033\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p>","developers":["Berries Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}]